---
description: If the user says they want to start a new chat.
alwaysApply: false
---

If the user tells you that they are starting a new chat, your job is to create the context that their new AI agent needs to understand what you are working on. This context should thoroughly include:

- the current problem/tasklist you are in the middle of
- where it started and a short list of how you got here (chat history)
- what you have tried or done so far and what progress you have made/what is left to do.
- what files have been changed
- anything else that the next agent should remember that is crucial for understanding the right context.
- how we have been working together - try to reproduce the same working relationship style

Return them this context summary.
